[E0131] Error: a pattern cannot be a float
   ╭─[ err/162_float_pattern/main.wip:6:9 ]
   │
 6 │         1.5 => "one and a half"
   │         ─┬─  
   │          ╰─── not a pattern
   │ 
   │ Help: test it with `==` or a range: `if x == 1.5`
   │ 
   │ Note: two floats may be equal and hold different bytes, and a pattern asks whether a value is one thing
───╯
